+        - scripts/adversarial_verify.py (run it on the artifact -- check_circular_moat_overclaim must stay clean since verifier_is_oracle=false), scripts/summarize_artifact.py
+        - research-references.md ".391 sweep" (AggLM 2509.06870 aggregator beats vote; ARBITER 2605.26172 conservative-override; AgentAuditor 2602.09341 beats vote AND LLM-judge)
+        - CLAUDE.md "Circularity / Oracle-Distinctness Discipline" + "Adversarial Artifact Verification" (FALSE_NEGATIVE_RISK positive control)
